<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1442967094"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:36.253"><div begin="15.558" end="41.997" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.558" end="21.951" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.558" end="16.039">还</span><span begin="16.138" end="16.871">记得</span><span begin="17.026" end="17.741">当天</span><span begin="17.741" end="18.572">旅</span><span begin="18.572" end="19.374">馆</span><span begin="19.374" end="20.172">的</span><span begin="20.683" end="21.103">门</span><span begin="21.103" end="21.951">牌</span></p><p begin="22.793" end="29.224" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.793" end="23.236">还</span><span begin="23.236" end="23.942">留住</span><span begin="23.942" end="24.803">笑着</span><span begin="24.803" end="25.624">离</span><span begin="25.624" end="26.548">开</span><span begin="26.548" end="27.103">的</span><span begin="27.663" end="28.144">神</span><span begin="28.144" end="29.224">态</span></p><p begin="30.156" end="36.057" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.156" end="30.903">当天</span><span begin="30.903" end="31.596">整个</span><span begin="31.596" end="32.239">城</span><span begin="32.239" end="32.844">市</span><span begin="33.092" end="33.510">那</span><span begin="33.510" end="34.176">样</span><span begin="34.361" end="34.779">轻</span><span begin="34.779" end="36.057">快</span></p><p begin="36.654" end="41.997" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.654" end="37.182">沿路</span><span begin="37.182" end="37.929">一起</span><span begin="37.929" end="38.739">走半</span><span begin="38.739" end="39.510">里</span><span begin="39.510" end="40.202">长</span><span begin="40.202" end="41.997">街</span></p></div><div begin="43.631" end="1:10.467" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.631" end="49.581" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.631" end="44.073">还</span><span begin="44.073" end="44.457">记</span><span begin="44.457" end="44.758">得</span><span begin="44.758" end="45.161">街</span><span begin="45.161" end="45.476">灯</span><span begin="45.476" end="46.225">照</span><span begin="46.225" end="46.878">出</span><span begin="47.183" end="48.061">一</span><span begin="48.385" end="48.841">脸</span><span begin="48.841" end="49.581">黄</span></p><p begin="50.139" end="56.462" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.139" end="50.520">还</span><span begin="50.520" end="51.354">燃亮</span><span begin="51.354" end="52.138">那份</span><span begin="52.138" end="54.680">微温的</span><span begin="55.117" end="55.480">便</span><span begin="55.480" end="56.462">当</span></p><p begin="57.231" end="1:03.008" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.231" end="57.975">剪影</span><span begin="57.975" end="58.412">的</span><span begin="58.412" end="58.872">你</span><span begin="58.872" end="59.363">轮</span><span begin="59.532" end="1:00.196">廓</span><span begin="1:00.594" end="1:01.771">太</span><span begin="1:01.771" end="1:02.193">好</span><span begin="1:02.193" end="1:03.008">看</span></p><p begin="1:03.407" end="1:10.467" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.407" end="1:03.889">凝住</span><span begin="1:03.889" end="1:04.755">眼</span><span begin="1:04.755" end="1:05.321">泪</span><span begin="1:05.521" end="1:06.376">才</span><span begin="1:06.376" end="1:06.883">敢</span><span begin="1:06.883" end="1:07.490">细</span><span begin="1:07.920" end="1:10.467">看</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.299" end="1:38.636" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:13.299" end="1:19.381" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.299" end="1:13.834">忘</span><span begin="1:13.834" end="1:14.178">掉</span><span begin="1:14.178" end="1:14.576">天</span><span begin="1:14.576" end="1:15.194">地</span> <span begin="1:15.385" end="1:15.785">彷</span><span begin="1:15.785" end="1:16.143">佛</span><span begin="1:16.143" end="1:16.925">也想</span><span begin="1:16.925" end="1:17.361">不</span><span begin="1:17.361" end="1:17.923">起</span><span begin="1:17.923" end="1:18.612">自</span><span begin="1:18.612" end="1:19.381">己<